    "body": "There's nothing in \"set an ImageBitmapRenderingContext's output bitmap\" that actually cleans up the `ImageBitmap` object though. That is, nothing that sets the [[Detached]] internal slot. And the step following that is mostly done for clarity and also makes some sense (as you could see it as them having a shared reference to the same bitmap).\r\n\r\nAt most I could see us creating shared steps for this and the `close()` method. Am I missing something?",
